# Raw screen recordings are large and regenerable — re-run `npm run record <id>`.
# The manifests next to them ARE committed: they hold the step timings the
# compositions depend on, so a render is reproducible without a re-record.
public/recordings/**/*.webm
public/recordings/**/*.mp4

